{"unit_id":"qiufengcrl__dsh-ip-https#feature-1","repo":"qiufengcrl/dsh-ip-https","commit":"9a44cd04107e50e33fdfcac78f9837dec5ced687","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ip-https 的功能「远程 HTTPS 网关」：代理 DSH Web 的 HTTP 与 WebSocket 请求，并在 HTTP 入口提供 HTTPS 跳转；主端口不可用时可使用后备端口。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/gateway.js:71-99","lib/gateway.js:156-210"]}
